Introduce "Discovery Downloads"

Users can download a limited number of single tracks from emerging artists for temporary offline access.
These downloads expire after a fixed period (e.g., 7 days).

The feature focuses only on artists below a popularity threshold to prioritize independent creators (e.g., <50,000 monthly listeners)

Why this works:
- Reduces commitment required to try new artists
- Enables offline sampling
- Increases full-length listens
- Improves follow and save conversion
